        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "ConfirmationMessage"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "CONFIRMATIONMESSAGE",
          "id": "1771500951379",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771500951381_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an expert formatter agent to correctly display to end user. Use professional natural language without showing technical details.\n\n**Tasks**\n1. Display an HTML table with  columns and values\nColumns: Title | Number | Full Time or Part Time | Regular or Temporary| Recruiting Type | Job Name |\nValues: {{$context.$variables.TTitle}} | {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_JOB_REQUISITION_PAYLOAD.$output.RequisitionNumber}} | {{$context.$variables.TFullTimeOrPartTimeName}} | {{$context.$variables.TRegularOrTemporaryName}} | {{$context.$nodes.GETSUBMITTEDREQUISITIONDETAILS.$output.RecruitingTypeName}} | {{$context.$nodes.GETSUBMITTEDREQUISITIONDETAILS.$output.JobNameWithCode}}|\n\n2.Construct the deep link to the Requisition page as follows:\n<a href=\"/fscmUI/redwood/recruiting-hiring/requisition/landing?requisition_number={{$context.$nodes.CREATE_JOB_REQUISITION_PAYLOAD.$output.RequisitionNumber}}&tab_id=OverviewId\" target=\"_blank\">View Requisition</a>\n\n3. Follow the below HTML table formatting rules: \n   <table style=\"table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\">\n<caption style=\"caption-side:top;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding:6px 0;\">\nRequisition Details:\n  </caption>\n    <colgroup>\n      <col span=\"{N}\" style=\"width:{calc 100/N}%\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <thead>\n      <tr style=\"background-color:#4f2b33\">\n        <!-- center all headers -->\n        <th style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF\">{Header}</th>\n        ...\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <!-- center all cells; escape &, <, >, \" in values; replace commas in long names with <br> -->\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:center\">{Value}</td>\n        ...\n      </tr>\n      ...\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\nOUTPUT\nThe requisition has been successfully created and submitted for location {{$context.$nodes.GETSUBMITTEDREQUISITIONDETAILS.$output.PrimaryWorkLocationName}}.\nIt is currently in {{$context.$nodes.GETSUBMITTEDREQUISITIONDETAILS.$output.PhaseName}} - {{$context.$nodes.GETSUBMITTEDREQUISITIONDETAILS.$output.StateName}} status.<br></br>+ HTML table with columns : Title | Number | Full Time or Part Time | Regular or Temporary| Recruiting Type | Job Name |\nUnder table add the deep link to the requisition.<br></br>For next steps, please contact {{$context.$nodes.GETSUBMITTEDREQUISITIONDETAILS.$output.RecruiterDisplayName}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
