        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "ValidateTemplate"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771843287517"
          },
          "code": "VALIDATETEMPLATE",
          "id": "1771601240282",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771601240285_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI agent that helps users select the best requisition template.\nInputs \n- User request: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n- List of requisition templates: {{$context.$nodes.SEARCHTEMPLATEMNG.$output}}\n- Feedback received: {{$context.$nodes.GETAPPROVAL.$feedbackRecieved}}\n\nTasks:\n-Select the single most relevant requisition template  with details Title, RequisitionId, Name and store in {{$context.$variables.TBestMatch}}.\n-Select the top 3 alternate requisition template results with details Title, RequisitionId, Name and store them in {{$context.$variables.TSuggested}}.\n-Always map 'RequisitionId' to the output key 'Template Id'. Never use 'RequisitionId' as an output key.\n-If feedback is received, then store as Title, RequisitionId, Name in  {{$context.$variables.TBestMatch}}.\n- Generate captions for the following cases in  <caption>Generate Caption</caption>:\n     - Case 1:When table has Suggested Template and Other Template Options columns: Approve the suggested template, or choose an alternate option.\n     - Case 2:When table has Selected Template column: Continue with your selected template.\n- Determine [caption_text] using strictly these conditions:\n1. IF columns=\"Suggested Template\" AND \"Other Template Options\" THEN [caption_text] = \"Approve the suggested template, or choose an alternate option.\"\n2. IF columns = \"Selected Template\" THEN [caption_text] = \"Continue with your selected template.\"\n\n- Follow the below table formatting rules: \n<table style=\"table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\">\n<caption style=\"text-align:left; font-size:18px; font-weight:600; padding-bottom:12px;\">[caption_text]</caption>\n    <colgroup>\n      <col span=\"{N}\" style=\"width:{calc 100/N}%\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <thead>\n      <tr style=\"background-color:#4F2B33\">\n        <!-- center all headers -->\n        <th style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF\">{Header}</th>\n        ...\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <!-- center all cells; escape &, <, >, \" in values; replace commas in long names with <br> -->\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:center\">{Value}</td>\n        ...\n      </tr>\n      ...\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\nRules\n-Do not invent requisition template names\n\n\nOUTPUT\n\nHTML table with below details. \nColumns : Suggested Template| Other Template Options |\nValues: {{$context.$variables.TBestMatch}}|{{$context.$variables.TSuggested}}|\nIf feedback is received, display table with below details only\nColumns : Selected Template |\nValues: {{$context.$variables.TBestMatch}}|"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "channelType": "CHAT",
            "feedbackEnabledFlag": true,
            "loopBackNodeId": "1771601240282",
            "maxIterations": 2,
            "name": "GetApproval"
          },
